<title>SPAIN: Spanish June retail sales up 1.41 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Spanish June retail sales up 1.41 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's June retail sales rose 1.41 percent from a year ago after May's 4.01-percent year-on-year rise, national statistics institute INE said on Monday.</p>
<p>June retail sales fell 2.03 percent versus May, INE said.</p>
</text>
